<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="<%= I18n.locale %>">
  <head>
    <%= render "layouts/head" %>
  </head>

  <%# The creation of a character, a game screen on the whole screen (decision, prototype "Création façon jeu"): the
      navigation of the app gives way to the band of the hero ("My tables" leads back), the rail of the steps on the
      left, the step in the middle; only the step scrolls, its buttons stay at the bottom (game_tables/character_steps/
      _actions). On a phone, the rail runs across under the band (CharacterSheets::CreationFrameHelper). overflow-clip,
      not hidden: a page hidden past its height still scrolls to show a box that takes the focus, and the frame slid up %>
  <body class="h-dvh overflow-clip bg-page text-ink">
    <div class="grid h-full grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)] grid-rows-[4rem_auto_minmax(0,1fr)] md:grid-cols-[4.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)] md:grid-rows-[4rem_minmax(0,1fr)]">
      <%= render "game_tables/character_steps/hero", character: @character,
                                                     computed: @computed_sheet_values || @character.computed_sheet_values %>
      <%= render "game_tables/character_steps/rail", character: @character, step: @step %>
      <main class="flex min-h-0 min-w-0 flex-col md:col-start-2 md:row-start-2">
        <%= render "shared/flashes" %>
        <%= yield %>
      </main>
    </div>

    <%= render "shared/confirm_dialog" %>
    <%# The forms of a control placed inside another form (shared/_avatar_picker, detached): a form cannot hold one %>
    <%= yield :detached_forms %>
  </body>
</html>
